From: Zachery Spector <howardzspector@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 03:49:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] 1358-N G3: S5 draft (droppable),
 withEmptyCompetitionsAndRomance at the 8 measure sites

One helper per file (1358-F9 ruling 6) beside the file's Save43 helper, applied at
its S5 comparison: every edge gains `competitions: []` and `romance: null`, mapped over
the old state's own edges (convertV43ToV44, save.ts:10776-10781). The helpers are
applied here because an unused helper fails the Bridge type gate (noUnusedLocals).
Not on sweep-g3: the parent keeps it with `git am` or drops it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
